{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15280","headline":"送路司谏侍从叔赴洪州 · 李端","name":"送路司谏侍从叔赴洪州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郄超本绝伦，得意在芳春。\n勳业耿家盛，风流荀氏均。\n声名金作赋，白皙玉爲身。\n敛笏辞天子，乘龟从丈人。\n度关行且猎，鞍马何躞蹀。\n猿啸暮应愁，湖流春好涉。\n浔阳水分送，于越山相接。\n梅雨细如丝，蒲帆轻似叶。\n逢风燕不定，值石波先叠。\n楼见远公庐，船经徐穉业。\n邑人多秉笔，州吏亦负笈。\n村女解收鱼，津童能用檝。\n唯我有荆扉，无成未得归。\n见君兄弟出，今日自沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}